[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0438","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0438.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-16584","title":"AWS API MCP Server 安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"AWS API MCP Server 在启动时加载安全策略执行数据，若加载失败则静默跳过后续所有请求的安全策略检查，导致用户配置的 deny 和 gate 规则失效。攻击者可通过诱导服务器在数据加载失败状态下启动（如网络不稳定），绕过安全策略执行本应被拒绝的 AWS API 操作。该漏洞影响版本 0.2.13 至 1.3.46，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。修复方式为升级至 1.3.47 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-16584","GHSA-29w2-fq35-v728"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-23T16:17:15.787","updated":"2026-07-23T19:16:53.537","remediation":"立即将 awslabs.aws-api-mcp-server 升级至 1.3.47 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可采取以下临时缓解措施：(1) 使用最小权限 IAM 凭证（如 ReadOnlyAccess 角色）限制可执行的操作范围；(2) 若服务器在断网状态下启动，待网络恢复后重启服务进程，确保安全策略数据正确加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-063-aws/","https://github.com/awslabs/mcp/security/advisories/GHSA-29w2-fq35-v728","https://pypi.org/project/awslabs.aws-api-mcp-server/1.3.47/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16584.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a786a0ea61d8ccdfe1545c54db2093e7bac073d1/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-16584.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-23/TIER_3_CVE-2026-16584.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/awslabs.aws-api-mcp-server/CVE-2026-16584.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16584.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-16584.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-16584.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-29w2-fq35-v728/GHSA-29w2-fq35-v728.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/60016b74ba80d27b93157e3586c48ea49a6dd37f/reports/2026/07/intel--1784826989_CVE-2026-16584_CVE-2026-16584.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-16584.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0438.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0267","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-42931","title":"Gitea NPM包标签接口存在未限制内存读取导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Gitea是一个轻量级自托管的Git服务。其NPM包标签API端点(AddPackageTag)在处理HTTP请求体时使用io.ReadAll()无限制地读取全部数据到内存中，未做任何大小限制。任何认证用户可通过发送单个大HTTP请求(约服务器可用内存80%)触发OOM(内存耗尽)，导致Gitea进程被操作系统终止。该问题影响Gitea 1.27.0之前的所有版本，攻击不需要事先创建NPM包，且并发请求可造成持续拒绝服务(即使Docker自动重启也会被立即再次攻击致死)。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-42931","GHSA-wwqq-x6w4-frm2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-21","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"升级到Gitea 1.27.0及以上版本，该版本在AddPackageTag函数中增加了请求体大小限制。如无法立即升级，可考虑在反向代理层限制请求体大小(如nginx client_max_body_size)，或禁用包注册功能模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T15:18:31.990923744+00:00","references":["https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-wwqq-x6w4-frm2","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.27.0","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wwqq-x6w4-frm2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0267.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0249","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-23603","title":"Gitea OAuth2头像同步功能中的盲SSRF漏洞","description":"Gitea 在启用 [oauth2_client] UPDATE_AVATAR = true 时，会使用 Go 默认 HTTP 客户端从 OAuth2/OIDC 提供商获取头像 URL。该 URL 来源于用户 OIDC 的 picture 声明。受影响代码路径调用 http.Get(url) 时未对出站主机或 IP 进行限制。低权限用户通过控制自己的 picture 声明，可诱导 Gitea 服务器向任意地址发起 HTTP GET 请求，包括回环地址、RFC 1918 私有网络地址及链路本地地址（如 169.254.169.254），导致盲 SSRF 攻击。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-23603","GHSA-x77v-q46j-393g"],"sources":["ghsa","cve"],"published":"2026-07-21","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"升级到 Gitea v1.27.0 或更高版本，该版本在 OAuth2 头像同步路径中增加了出站请求的主机/IP 限制。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 [oauth2_client] UPDATE_AVATAR 配置项以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T12:14:29.736011386+00:00","references":["https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-x77v-q46j-393g","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38406","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38426","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/commit/de4b8277e9cb576f2315fb03b5ab6478b42a1d31","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/commit/f69e15afe7496cc62e96dab244629c69eb31a7bf","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.27.0"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0249.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0249.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0219","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0219.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"大华智能物联综合管理平台 ICC 多个接口远程代码执行漏洞","description":"大华智能物联综合管理平台 ICC 的 /evo-runs/v1.0/ 及 /evo-apigw/admin/ 等接口存在远程代码执行漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可通过向受影响接口发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响大华 ICC 系列产品，攻击者可利用该漏洞完全控制目标服务器，危害严重。建议联系厂商获取安全补丁或临时限制受影响接口仅允许内网管理 IP 访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-0541a28b"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"联系大华厂商获取官方安全补丁并升级至最新版本；临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙上限制 /evo-runs/v1.0/ 和 /evo-apigw/admin/ 接口仅允许内网管理 IP 访问，部署 WAF 拦截远程代码执行特征 payload，并启用 API 异常调用日志监控加强对 /evo-runs/ 和 /evo-apigw/ 路径的访问审计。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0219.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0193","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0193.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"汉王e脸通综合管理平台任意文件上传漏洞","description":"汉王e脸通综合管理平台 uploadMapFile.do 接口存在任意文件上传漏洞，由于未对上传文件类型进行有效的白名单校验，未授权的远程攻击者可通过构造特制 HTTP 请求直接上传恶意的 JSP 脚本文件，获取服务器 WebShell 权限，进而执行任意系统命令、窃取敏感数据或横向攻击内网。该漏洞影响汉王e脸通综合管理平台多个版本，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-03cfaf11"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"对 uploadMapFile.do 接口添加文件类型白名单校验，仅允许图片类型文件上传；禁用 JSP 目录的写入执行权限；限制该接口仅允许内网 IP 访问；部署 WAF 规则拦截文件上传请求中的恶意脚本内容；定期审计服务器上传目录中的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T13:38:59.443537122+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0193.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0178","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0178.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"易宇通 KingTrans 物流管理系统 SQL注入漏洞","description":"易宇通 KingTrans 物流管理系统的 getAccountTypeByNumber 接口存在 SQL 注入漏洞，由于未对 number 参数进行充分过滤和参数化查询，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的 SQL 语句注入到后端数据库，导致数据库中的用户信息、物流订单等敏感数据被非法窃取或篡改。该漏洞影响 KingTrans 物流管理系统的多个版本，攻击者可利用该接口在公网直接进行探测利用，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-02cdc347"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"在代码层面对 number 参数改为预编译/参数化查询并做白名单校验，禁止拼接 SQL；将该接口限制为仅内网或 VPN 可访问，并在前置 WAF/网关拦截 union/select/sleep 等 SQL 注入特征作为临时缓解措施。联系易宇通厂商获取安全补丁或升级至最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0178.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0155","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0155.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"捷顺 JieLink+ 智能终端操作平台 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"捷顺 JieLink+ 智能终端操作平台存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者可通过向 deviceId 参数构造恶意 SQL 语句，绕过身份认证获取数据库敏感信息或执行任意 SQL 命令。该漏洞影响相关平台的多个版本，攻击条件低，无需高级权限即可远程利用，危害较大。建议用户联系厂商获取安全补丁，对 deviceId 参数实施参数化查询，并限制相关接口仅允许内网访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-01a467be"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"对所有输入参数（尤其是 deviceId）实施参数化查询或预编译语句，禁止拼接 SQL 语句；限制该接口仅允许可信内网 IP 访问；部署 WAF 规则拦截 SQL 注入攻击特征，如检测单引号、恒真条件等常见注入载荷；联系捷顺厂商获取最新安全补丁并升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0141","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0141.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Cisco Catalyst SD-WAN Controller 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst SD-WAN Controller 中存在认证绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过向 UDP 12346 端口发送特制报文绕过身份验证机制，未授权访问控制器管理接口，进而获取设备配置信息并可能进一步控制受影响设备，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-00add8b5"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"升级至 Cisco Catalyst SD-WAN Controller 20.19.1 及以上版本，同时在网络边界防火墙上禁止 UDP 12346 端口对外暴露，限制管理接口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T16:18:29.434543999+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0266","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0266.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-40187","title":"EGroupware eTemplate 认证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"EGroupware 存在经认证的远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者以管理员身份登录后，可通过上传恶意的 eTemplate XML 文件（.xet）到 VFS 的 /etemplates 目录触发该漏洞。漏洞根因在于 Widget::expand_name() 方法将模板控件属性值直接传入 PHP eval() 函数执行，且仅对双引号进行了转义，未对反引号做任何过滤。在 PHP 中，eval() 字符串内的反引号会被当作 shell 命令执行，导致攻击者可从 Web 应用权限提升至服务器操作系统级任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 EGroupware 26.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。官方 Docker 部署因配置了 disable_functions 限制不受影响，但裸机、虚拟机或未加固的容器部署均存在风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-40187","GHSA-8737-2x9g-xjj7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-20T17:17:07.690","updated":"2026-07-20T18:16:51.863","remediation":"tags as required by the specification.<value>立即将 EGroupware 升级至 26.4.20260413（主版本线）或 23.1.20260601（旧版线）及以上版本，修复 Widget::expand_name() 中 eval() 反引号未转义问题。如无法升级，在 php.ini 中设置 disable_functions = shell_exec,exec,passthru,system,proc_open,popen 以阻断反引符执行系统命令；Docker 官方部署默认已含此加固配置，需确保未被移除或覆盖。同时严格限制管理员账号仅授予可信任人员。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/EGroupware/egroupware/security/advisories/GHSA-8737-2x9g-xjj7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2026/40xxx/CVE-2026-40187.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-40187.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-20/TIER_2_CVE-2026-40187.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2026/40xxx/CVE-2026-40187.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/packagist/egroupware/egroupware/CVE-2026-40187.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/234f830f64cdc68cb0704070f7453dab13cb7503/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-40187/README.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-40187-egroupware-has-authenticated-rce-via-malicious-etemplate-upload.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/a764a3a240add0279626a01e6510fa9b627353f4/posts/cve-2026-40187-composer-egroupware-egroupware.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-40187.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-40187.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0266.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0256","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0256.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27823","title":"EGroupware 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"EGroupware 存在远程代码执行漏洞，源于不正确的授权检查机制（CWE-285），结合文件写入原语和任意文件读取漏洞，使得经过身份认证的攻击者能够在服务器上执行任意命令。若系统启用了用户自助注册功能，则攻击者可在无需预先认证的情况下利用该漏洞，实现完全的系统控制。该漏洞影响 EGroupware 多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高危。厂商已在 26.2.20260224 及 23.1.20260224 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27823","GHSA-h9qx-v5xp-ph8p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-20T16:16:57.680","updated":"2026-07-21T16:17:07.783","remediation":"立即将 EGroupware 升级到 26.2.20260224（26.x 分支）或 23.1.20260224（23.x 分支）及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在管理后台关闭用户自助注册功能（user self-registration），并在 Web 服务器层面限制对 index.php 中 importexport_export_ui.download 及 SmallParT 相关端点的非授权访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/EGroupware/egroupware/security/advisories/GHSA-h9qx-v5xp-ph8p","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27823.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27823.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-20/TIER_2_CVE-2026-27823.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/packagist/egroupware/egroupware/CVE-2026-27823.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-27823.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-27823-egroupware-has-a-remote-code-execution-vulnerability.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-h9qx-v5xp-ph8p/GHSA-h9qx-v5xp-ph8p.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27823.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-27823.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/95b903de754cd34d47ddff19406c10a874de7522/reports/2026/07/intel--45640a2df63dac0c.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0256.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0245","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-16221","title":"fast-uri 主机混淆漏洞（反斜杠权限定符解析差异导致 SSRF 绕过）","description":"fast-uri 是 Node.js 生态中广泛使用的 URL 解析库，其 2.3.1 至 4.1.0 版本存在主机混淆漏洞。该漏洞源于 fast-uri 未将反斜杠字符（U+005C）视为 authority 分隔符，而 Node.js 原生的 WHATWG URL 解析器（被 fetch、undici 及 http/https 客户端使用）会将特殊协议（http/https/ws/wss/ftp/file）中的反斜杠标准化为斜杠。攻击者可构造形如 `http://evil.com\\@allowed.com` 的恶意 URL，使 fast-uri 解析出 `allowed.com` 作为目标主机，而 Node.js 实际请求 `evil.com`，从而绕过基于主机的白名单、黑名单、SSRF 过滤、重定向验证或出站代理路由策略，将请求劫持到云元数据端点、回环地址或内部网络主机。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-16221","GHSA-v2hh-gcrm-f6hx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-19T15:16:49.027","updated":"2026-07-21T18:31:51.680","remediation":"将 fast-uri 升级到 4.1.1, 3.1.4 或 2.4.3 及以上版本（根据当前使用的 major 版本选择对应分支），即可修复此主机混淆漏洞。由于无临时的缓解措施可用，应优先安排升级并重新测试依赖该库的 URL 校验逻辑。运行 `npm update fast-uri` 或修改 package.json 中 fast-uri 的版本号后执行 `npm install`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri/security/advisories/GHSA-v2hh-gcrm-f6hx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16221.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-16221.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-19/TIER_2_CVE-2026-16221.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/fast-uri/CVE-2026-16221.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-16221","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16221.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-16221.md","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/50fdfc605f6e626e4cc9d8c6ab46b2329edadea9/advisories/cve/CVE-2026-16221.md","https://github.com/epam/ai-dial-admin-frontend/blob/df71c07f4b4826014f09c70b62d0d3f780cf8637/.trivyignore","https://github.com/archestra-ai/archestra/blob/2d8c4fe06aee1b22314ad815f424881cfb3cd4c1/platform/pnpm-workspace.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0245.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0245.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0315","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49485","title":"HL7 FHIR Core FHIRPathEngine 正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HAPI FHIR 的 FHIRPathEngine 实现中存在正则表达式拒绝服务（ReDoS）漏洞。FHIRPathEngine 接受任意 FHIRPath 表达式且未做输入验证，其 matches()、matchesFull() 和 replaceMatches() 函数将用户可控的正则表达式传递给 Java 的 Pattern.compile() 和 String.replaceAll()，但超时机制存在缺陷——仅取消了执行线程却无法终止线程内的正则运算。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 FHIR Validator HTTP 端点发送包含恶意正则模式（如 (a+)+$）的资源，触发 Java 正则引擎的指数级回溯（O(2^n) 时间复杂度），导致 CPU 资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 6.9.9 和 6.9.4.2 之前的所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49485","GHSA-7cmj-v6x8-frvv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T22:17:16.893","updated":"2026-07-20T15:16:39.090","remediation":"立即升级 org.hl7.fhir.core 至 6.9.9 或 6.9.4.2 及以上版本，这两个版本已修复 FHIRPathEngine 中 matches()/replaceMatches() 的正则回溯问题。如无法立即升级，可在 FHIR Validator HTTP 端点入口处增加输入校验，限制 FHIRPath 表达式的来源为可信用户，并在网关层对 /fhir 路径设置请求频率限制和超时阈值以缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/commit/109c88837c032ef399b2eb87ddde86692065cf41","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/commit/e08982d2b6f6dcd6c670a762d9cf999179fbe4ed","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/pull/2463","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/releases/tag/6.9.4.2","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/releases/tag/6.9.9","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/security/advisories/GHSA-7cmj-v6x8-frvv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49485.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49485.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49485.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/ca.uhn.hapi.fhir/org.hl7.fhir.r4/CVE-2026-49485.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49485.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-49485.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/3f9f364bccc73ba3de8be88b66bacb6688594e5b/posts/cve-2026-49485-maven-ca-uhn-hapi-fhir-org-hl7-fhir-dstu2.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49485.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2dd0160b9ec0105216522022a89e49e69be74f7e/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7cmj-v6x8-frvv/GHSA-7cmj-v6x8-frvv.json","https://github.com/abhishekaryan23/onived-blog/blob/e11db14729a4e8982e7232bbe0cd7eb89bc207f6/site/src/content/cve/cve-2026-49485.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0349","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50274","title":"Datadog dd-trace-go W3C Baggage 标头解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Datadog dd-trace-go Go 客户端库在解析 W3C  baggage 传播头时存在资源分配无限制漏洞。该库在提取（extract）路径上未对 baggage HTTP 头的条目数量（默认上限 64）和总字节数（默认上限 8192）进行限制，仅对注入（inject）路径实施了检查。远程未认证攻击者可向目标服务发送包含任意大量逗号分隔键值对或单个超大值的 baggage 头，导致服务端为每个键值对分配哈希表条目，造成 CPU 和内存资源耗尽，引发拒绝服务。启用 baggage 传播风格的 HTTP 服务均受影响，该风格在大多数受影响追踪器中默认开启。DataDog 已在 dd-trace-go 2.8.1 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50274","GHSA-74j5-xf3v-crq8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:07.337","updated":"2026-07-20T16:17:04.673","remediation":"立即将 dd-trace-go 升级至 2.8.1 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，从 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE 中移除 baggage（或设置 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE_EXTRACT 排除 baggage），并在反向代理层限制 HTTP 请求头大小（如 Nginx 设置 large_client_header_buffers 4 8k，Envoy 设置 max_request_headers_kb）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/commit/192712ba0291b2e89166259111ebb5e90c8f52df","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/pull/4720","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/releases/tag/v2.8.1","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/security/advisories/GHSA-74j5-xf3v-crq8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50274.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50274.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/CVE-2026-50274.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50274.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50274.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50274.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/927c9425d8f7f6609247b04933b3bb339d0de5f8/posts/cve-2026-50274-go-github-com-datadog-dd-trace-go.html","https://github.com/abhishekaryan23/onived-blog/blob/e11db14729a4e8982e7232bbe0cd7eb89bc207f6/site/src/content/cve/cve-2026-50274.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2026-50274.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/a6bf5ac7a2ca0e41f63a084ce77e4e18a9b97446/CVEs_log/2026-07-18_zh.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0349.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0349.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0347","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0347.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50272","title":"DataDog dd-trace-js W3C Baggage 标头解析不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"dd-trace-js（Datadog APM Node.js 客户端）在解析 W3C baggage 传播头时未对提取路径实施条目数（默认 64）和字节大小（默认 8192）限制。远程未认证攻击者可发送包含大量逗号分隔键值对或单个超大值的 baggage 请求头，导致服务端为每个请求分配哈希表条目，造成 CPU 和内存资源无限消耗，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有启用 baggage 传播的 HTTP 服务，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 5.100.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50272","GHSA-wxqq-gcq8-c443"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:07.200","updated":"2026-07-21T04:16:50.977","remediation":"升级 dd-trace-js 至 5.100.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，从 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE 中移除 baggage 以禁用其提取，或在反向代理层限制 HTTP 请求头大小（如 Nginx 设置 large_client_header_buffers、Apache 设置 LimitRequestFieldSize、Envoy 设置 max_request_headers_kb）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/commit/a7d4c0da05f67cde05a99272b725a317c461d0e6","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/pull/8255","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/releases/tag/v5.100.0","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/security/advisories/GHSA-wxqq-gcq8-c443","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50272.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/dd-trace/CVE-2026-50272.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50272.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50272.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50272.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/93d5167c4976c9015270e856ca23ec6140d458aa/posts/cve-2026-50272-npm-dd-trace.html","https://github.com/danielfebrero/Fresh0day-PoCs/blob/ed049b0f8549b25b92b26174db3899b34db0b04f/CVE-2026-50272/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wxqq-gcq8-c443/GHSA-wxqq-gcq8-c443.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50272.json","https://github.com/abhishekaryan23/onived-blog/blob/e11db14729a4e8982e7232bbe0cd7eb89bc207f6/site/src/content/cve/cve-2026-50272.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0347.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0347.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0347.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0346","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0346.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50271","title":"Datadog dd-trace-py W3C Baggage 头解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Datadog dd-trace-py（Python APM 客户端）在解析 W3C Baggage HTTP 头时存在资源分配不当漏洞。该库在提取（extract）路径上未对 Baggage 头的条目数量（默认上限 64）和总字节数（默认上限 8192）进行限制，而仅对注入（injection）路径施加了限制。远程未认证攻击者可向目标服务发送包含大量逗号分隔键值对或单个超大值的 Baggage 头，导致 tracer 为每个键值对分配哈希表条目，从而消耗无限制的 CPU 和内存资源，造成拒绝服务。该 Baggage 传播风格在多数受影响版本中默认启用，任何使用受影响 dd-trace-py 版本且暴露于互联网的 HTTP 服务均受影响。已在 dd-trace-py 4.8.2 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50271","GHSA-mw54-j2v2-42hr"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:07.070","updated":"2026-07-20T20:16:44.510","remediation":"立即将 dd-trace-py 升级至 4.8.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，从 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE 中移除 baggage 以禁用 baggage 提取；同时在上游代理或 Web 服务器（如 Nginx large_client_header_buffers、Apache LimitRequestFieldSize）限制 HTTP 请求头最大大小作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/commit/9c80faa3dcfe238d008c3b3cd0b8e5dfef0aa4cd","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/pull/17926","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/releases/tag/v4.8.2","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/security/advisories/GHSA-mw54-j2v2-42hr","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50271.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/ddtrace/CVE-2026-50271.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50271.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb